 "about": "Cues for the temp guide track. Frames at 24 fps. The relay click is the film's metronome: 1+1+3 opens and closes it. The three relay clicks inside the film (178, 424, 843) sit on the frame where the armature lands and the spark shows, three frames after the cut into each relay shot. 640 is the one click left when the kick goes. The four keys at 917 to 923 are the last four letters arriving on the laptop's screen. The soft ticks of the decoded sentence (702 to 720) are placed by tools/mix.py, two letters to a tick.",
